WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.950
Breathe with me. A calm breathing exercise for a stressful moment. Sit comfortably and relax your shoulders.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.950
Breathe in slowly for four counts.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.950
Breathe out slowly for four counts.

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.950
Breathe in slowly for four counts.

5
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.950
Breathe out slowly for four counts.

6
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.950
Breathe in slowly for four counts.

7
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.950
Breathe out slowly for four counts.

8
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.950
Breathe in slowly for four counts.

9
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.950
Breathe out slowly for four counts.

10
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.950
Well done. Notice how your body feels now. If you feel dizzy, stop and breathe normally.

